.com/2026/09/28/amd-acquires-world-labs-startup-fei-fei-li-8-2-billion/</link><description>这笔交易汇集了人工智能行业的两位领先女性，并为 AMD 在与 GPU 竞争对手 Nvidia 的竞争中提供了新的支撑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-28-at-24436-PM.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:56:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/amd-acquires-world-labs-startup-fei-fei-li-8-2-billion/</guid></item><item><title>中国悄悄靠大豆赢得了特朗普</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/china-trump-xi-soybeans-farmers-midwest/</link><description>特朗普和习近平削减了双方价值 300 亿美元商品的关税，但没有削减爱荷华州农民赖以生存的大豆&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296993948_185977-e1790630795829.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:39:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/china-trump-xi-soybeans-farmers-midwest/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能原生组织结构图可能是这样的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/heres-what-the-ai-native-org-chart-could-look-like/</link><description>未来的组织结构图可以跟踪系统访问、支出权限以及人工智能代理的位置，而不是显示谁向谁报告。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1992829718-1-e1790350550822.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:59:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/heres-what-the-ai-native-org-chart-could-look-like/</guid></item><item><title>“令美国伙伴不安”：专家警告称，特朗普向中国出售武器的提议表明他承认自己没有认真对待中国的安全威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/trump-us-arms-sale-china-xi-jinping-summit-national-security-threats-taiwan-weapons-package/</link><description>政策专家表示，尽管白宫否认有这样的计划，但军售将彻底破坏美国阻止中国成为超级大国的努力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296993948-e1790622183713.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:33:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/trump-us-arms-sale-china-xi-jinping-summit-national-security-threats-taiwan-weapons-package/</guid></item><item><title>图书馆正在成为降低生活成本的工具，一些图书馆的注册人数激增</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/libraries-affordability-recession-indicator/</link><description>随着生活成本的下降，图书馆通过免费流媒体、本地企业折扣和技术帮助来吸引用户&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1190621120-e1790352075845.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:58:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/libraries-affordability-recession-indicator/</guid></item><item><title>美国科学家正在把目光投向国外。欧洲企业能赚钱吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/americas-scientists-are-looking-abroad-can-european-business-cash-in/</link><description>随着美国研究经费面临压力，欧洲公司和机构正在寻求吸引美国顶尖的 STEM 人才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2236239187_2880x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/americas-scientists-are-looking-abroad-can-european-business-cash-in/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能公司必须提防那些贪图便宜的人免费燃烧代币，并一次破坏一个注册者的利润</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/ai-unit-economics-token-theft-stripe/</link><description>在代币经济学中，每一个提示都有一个价格。那么谁付钱呢？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sarita-Singh-at-Stripe-Tour-Singapore-e1790581232434.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/ai-unit-economics-token-theft-stripe/</guid></item></channel></rss>